      "agent_response": "That sounds lovely — glad it was so rejuvenating. Want help turning that into an email or message?\n\nHere are two short options you can use or edit:\n\n- To Emma:\n  Hi Emma — I had such a wonderful time at the retreat with you last weekend. Practicing in that serene setting felt so rejuvenating. Thank you for being such great company — let’s plan another getaway soon! I’ll send photos in a follow-up.\n\n- To the retreat organizers (thank-you):\n  Hi — thank you for the wonderful yoga retreat last weekend. The location and instruction were truly restorative — I left feeling refreshed and inspired. Please let me know about future dates; I’d love to attend again.\n\nWould you like me to:\n- Draft one of these and save it to drafts?\n- Send one now (tell me which and to which email)?\n- Help write a longer message or include photos?\n\nTell me what you want to do and I’ll take care of it.",
