      "agent_response": "Got it — I’ve noted that you tried a new hiking trail with your friend Sophia this weekend and the views were breathtaking.\n\nWhat would you like me to do with that memory? Here are some quick options (I won’t send anything until you tell me which and provide any recipient addresses):\n\n1) Message Sophia\n   - Sample: \"Hi Sophia — that hike this weekend was amazing. The views were breathtaking! Thanks for coming — want to plan another one soon?\"\n   - Send now or save as draft? If send, tell me Sophia’s email (or say “send to Sophia” if you’ve emailed her before and want me to find the thread).\n\n2) Message your painting / activity friends\n   - Sample: \"Hey — I tried a new hiking trail with Sophia this weekend and loved it. Want to plan another outdoor adventure after our next painting session?\"\n   - Tell me recipients or ask me to search for the painting group thread.\n\n3) Weekend recap email/note (to yourself or someone)\n   - Sample subject: \"Weekend recap\"\n   - Sample body: \"Quick recap — yoga retreat with Emma (rejuvenating), dinner with Mia (delicious), painting with friends (so fun), rock climbing with James (thrilling), hike with Sophia (breathtaking views).\"\n   - Send to your email or save as draft?\n\n4) Just save this memory as a draft/note for later\n   - I can create a draft email to yourself with the memory list.\n\nAlso: do you want to include photos from the hike or any other weekend activity? Tell me which option you want and whether to send now or save as a draft — and provide the recipient email(s) if you want something sent.",
